~ wall_caretaker
if wall_is_attacking()
	Wall Keeper: The raiders are still attacking. We can repair the wall once they leave.
elif wall_work_available()
	Wall Keeper: The wall needs repairs. I can restore it now, free of charge.
else
	Wall Keeper: The wall is in good condition. No repairs are needed.
- Repair wall (free) [if wall_work_available()]
	do wall_select_work()
	=> END
- Not now
	do wall_select_leave()
	=> END
